  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the basmati rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
